# The synthetic corpus in data/ is intentionally NOT ignored - committing it
# makes the repo self-demoing, and it is generated, not sensitive. Nor is
# data/reconciliation_example.xlsx, the committed worked example.
#
# But the default output name is ignored, because the Summary tab stamps the
# time it was generated - so every run would otherwise show up as a change to a
# committed file.
data/reconciliation.xlsx
output/
*.recon.csv
*.recon.html
